{"ref":"BDB, קְנַז","hw":"קְנַז","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קְנַז</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> in Edom, Κενεζ: son of Eliphaz <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:11\" href=\"/Genesis.36.11\">Gn 36:11</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.36\">1 Ch 1:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:15\" href=\"/Genesis.36.15\">Gn 36:15</a> cf. v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:42\" href=\"/Genesis.36.42\">42</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:53\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.53\">1 Ch 1:53</a>, and father of Othniel <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:17\" href=\"/Joshua.15.17\">Jos 15:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:13\" href=\"/Judges.1.13\">Ju 1:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:9\" href=\"/Judges.3.9\">3:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:11\" href=\"/Judges.3.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.13\">1 Ch 4:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.15\">15</a> (v. Bu<sup>RS 9</sup> Mey<sup>Entstehung 115f.</sup>).","next":"BDB, קְנִזִּי","prev":"BDB, קָנָה²"}